  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/9ec3ad307c20fb724e977ae5ad0de2c6717ff0e4" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:9.111ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle i\colon Z\to X}"/></span> be the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inclusion_map" title="Inclusion map" id="mwWA">inclusion map</a>.  Choose a differential form <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt26" id="mwWQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\alpha"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle \alpha }">
  <semantics>
