  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/053a6e91564cd2d85cd9f9d8af4b550187c90a0b" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -2.338ex; width:6.444ex; height:5.676ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \int _{Z}i^{*}\alpha }"/></span></dd></dl>

<p id="mwYg">To evaluate this integral, choose a point of <i id="mwYw">Z</i> and call it <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt31" id="mwZA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"z=(z_1, \\ldots, z_k)"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle z=(z_{1},\ldots ,z_{k})}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>z</mi>
