</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/65e5591145d18c29a36a8ea6be234b03743b18de" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:19.751ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle z_{k+1}=\cdots =z_{n}=0}"/></span> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rank-nullity_theorem" title="Rank-nullity theorem" class="mw-redirect" id="mwag">rank-nullity theorem</a>).  If <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt33" id="mwaw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"p>k"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle p>k}">
