    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle N^{c}H^{k}(X,\mathbf {Z} )\subseteq H^{k}(X,\mathbf {Z} )\cap (H^{k-c,c}(X)\oplus \cdots \oplus H^{c,k-c}(X)).}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/b38bad182e7a4c9413d6a9a2c0f177a5eaa2bba6" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:59.19ex; height:3.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle N^{c}H^{k}(X,\mathbf {Z} )\subseteq H^{k}(X,\mathbf {Z} )\cap (H^{k-c,c}(X)\oplus \cdots \oplus H^{c,k-c}(X)).}"/></span></dd></dl>

<p id="mwAVg">Hodge's original statement was:</p>

<dl id="mwAVk"><dd id="mwAVo"><dl id="mwAVs"><dd id="mwAVw"><b id="mwAV0">Generalized Hodge conjecture, Hodge's version.</b>  <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt98" id="mwAV4" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"N^cH^k(X, \\mathbf{Z}) = H^k(X, \\mathbf{Z}) \\cap (H^{k-c,c}(X) \\oplus\\cdots\\oplus H^{c,k-c}(X))."}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" class="mathjax_ignore" alttext="{\displaystyle N^{c}H^{k}(X,\mathbf {Z} )=H^{k}(X,\mathbf {Z} )\cap (H^{k-c,c}(X)\oplus \cdots \oplus H^{c,k-c}(X)).}">
